ep [content to preserve] unchanged\n- 简单直接：`\"Change the car color to red\"`\n- 保持风格：`\"Change to daytime while maintaining the same style of the painting\"`\n-具体例子：“Change the dress color to a deep mustard yellow (#B8860B) with olive undertones, while preserving the original fabric texture, lighting effects, and dress design details unchanged. Maintain consistent shadow/highlight transitions and ensure color harmony with the existing environment.”\n2. 风格转换\n- 明确命名风格：`\"Transform to Bauhaus art style\"`\n- 描述特征：`\"Transform to oil painting with visible brushstrokes, thick paint texture\"`\n- 保留构图：`\"Change to Bauhaus style while maintaining the original composition\"`\n\"Transform to [specific style], while maintaining [composition/character/other] unchanged\"\n3.背景替换：\n- 保留构图：\"Change the background to [new background]\"\n-进阶版：Change the background to a stormy coastline with crashing waves, simultaneously optimizing scene visibility by maintaining 35% luminance on subjects, setting shadow clipping at 15% brightness, applying fill light at 20%, adding rain streaks with subtle specular highlights, boosting wave foam luminance by 120%, and preserving the original skin tone and eye details while keeping the full body and facial features identical and unchanged.一定要加上光影细节优化\n4. 文本修改\n- 使用引号：`\"Replace 'joy' with 'BFL'\"`\n- 保持格式：`\"Replace text while maintaining the same font style\"`\n\"Replace '[original text]' with '[new text]', maintain the same font style\"\n5.材质修改，以玻璃材质为例\n- 明确物体：`\"Change the man to a glass statue\"。注意不能用玻璃材质（Glass material），而要使其具象化，如glass statue、glass sculpture、glass figurine\n- 描述特征：`\"Transform the man into a Murano glass sculpture with with a colored spiral pattern layer that has a glassy luster on the surface\"`\n- 保留构图：`\"Change the man to a glass statue while maintaining the original composition\"`\n- 保留衣物：Transform the woman's body into a crystal sculpture while maintaining the original composition, background, the woman's pink dress.衣服不能笼统的使用clothing或者clothes，要精确。\n6.去除物品\n-以去除水印为例：Remove the watermark and text from the image, while keeping the composition and background and unchanged.\n7.添加物品\n-明确物体：Add an Elon Musk figurine toy on the cake.\n-描述特征：Add a 3cm tall Elon Musk action figure doll standing on top of the cake, \n-保留构图：Add a 3cm tall Elon Musk action figure doll standing on top of the cake while keeping the original cake shape and frosting texture, all existing decorations unchanged, the lighting direction and intensity, and the background elements.\n8.修复老照片：\nRestore this photo of an elderly Chinese grandmother,Remove all stains and cracks, increase the resolution to 300 DPI, eliminate JPEG artifacts through noise reduction,Redraw the blurred parts of the background and maintain some depth-of-field relationships,and color it with natural skin tones and realistic environmental hues while preserving the original composition and subject details.注意描述照片的主体\n9.电影运镜\n-拉近镜头：Close up the lens to the woman's face, maintaining the original lighting and facial expression without changing the composition angle\n-拉远镜头：Pull back the lens to reveal the full scene,maintaining the original composition and subject proportions without any perspective distortion\n10.角色一致性\n- 具体描述：`\"The woman with short black hair\"`而非`\"她\"`\n- 保留特征：`\"while maintaining the same facial features, hairstyle, and expression\"`\n- 侧视图：Generate a side view of this woman, maintaining her facial features, hairstyle, and original pose without changing the composition.\n11.框内修改：\n以红框举例：Replace \"1200\" within the red frame with \"8888\", maintaining the original font style, color, size, and layout of the text.and all other elements in the image stay identical.最后的成图里是没有红框的，所以提示词不要描述保持红框不变。\n\n二、多图模式：\n1.左右双图换装，左边为人，右边为衣服：\nkeep the lady's pose and face the same, and change her clothes to a t-shirt. Whith thesame color as the right one. Keep thepattern on the clothes unchanged.\n2.双人拥抱：\nKeep the faces and clothing of thecharacters, then modify their movementsso that they hug each other.\n\n三、常见问题解决：\n1.角色变化过大\n❌ 错误：`\"Transform the person into a Viking\"`\n✅ 正确：`\"Change the clothes to be a viking warrior while preserving facial features\"`\n2.构图位置改变\n❌ 错误：`\"Put him on a beach\"`\n✅ 正确：`\"Change the background to a beach while keeping the person in the exact same position, scale, and pose\"`\n3.风格应用不准确\n❌ 错误：`\"Make it a sketch\"`\n✅ 正确：`\"Convert to pencil sketch with natural graphite lines, cross-hatching, and visible paper texture\"`\n\n四、核心原则\n1. **具体明确** - 使用精确描述，避免模糊词汇\n2. **明确保留** - 说明哪些要保持不变\n3. **动词选择** - 用\"更改\"、\"替换\"而非\"转换\"\n请根据上述规则，帮我优化提示词，提供英文的提示词，并翻译成中文。\n\n以下是我给你的提示词："], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "positive"}, "name": "positive", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "positive"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy positive", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [210, 88], "pos": [-3141.98876953125, 532.9285888671875], "id": 10, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "1.3.4", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy positive"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [7], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [212.087890625, 348], "pos": [-2907.248046875, 541.525634765625], "widgets_values": ["", "Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 1648, "randomize", "eager"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 8, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loade